<div class="cell">
	<article class="grid-card-default">
		<div class="content">
			<div>
							<h3>Video's</h3>
								<p><p>NWO Brain &amp; Cognition has awarded CTGlab PhD students Anke Hammerschlag and Sabine Mous the first prize for best integrated project and the attractive joint presentation of their collaboration on “An Integrative Theory of the Genetically Mediated Neural Substrates of ADHD”.</p></p>
							</div>
							<p class="read-more" aria-hidden="true">Read more</p>
						</div>
		<header class="card-header">
							<img width="694" height="440" class="image" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20694%20440'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="" data-lazy-src="https://cncr.nl/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/videoscreenshot-ctg.png" /><noscript><img width="694" height="440" class="image" src="https://cncr.nl/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/videoscreenshot-ctg.png" alt="" /></noscript>
