</div>
<div class="cell">
	<article class="grid-card-default">
		<div class="content">
			<div>
							<h3>About us</h3>
								<p>CTGlab was setup in 2008 by Danielle Posthuma as a small research group within the <a href="http://www.cncr.nl">CNCR</a> at the VU and the <a href="http://www.vumc.nl">Amsterdam University Medical Centre</a>. Since 2014 CTGlab is a sub-department of the CNCR and Amsterdam-UMC. We participate in <a href="https://www.amsterdamresearch.org/web/neuroscience/home.htm">Amsterdam Neuroscience</a>.</p>
							</div>
							<p class="read-more" aria-hidden="true">Read more</p>
						</div>
		<header class="card-header">
							<img width="466" height="231" class="image" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20466%20231'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="" data-lazy-src="https://cncr.nl/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/about-us.jpg" /><noscript><img width="466" height="231" class="image" src="https://cncr.nl/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/about-us.jpg" alt="" /></noscript>
