			src="https://cncr.nl/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Foto-Schipper-Posthuma-300x144.jpg"
			 alt="Foto Schipper Posthuma"		></noscript>
	</picture>
			</header>
					<a href="https://cncr.nl/news-article/dna-from-embryonic-brain-provides-insight-into-psychiatric-disorders/" class="overlay-link">
